            "‘The G. B.,’ said H. O., and I winked at him to shut up, but he didn’t see me, and the G. B. did. He waved his hand at _me_ to shut up, so I had to, and H. O. went on--‘It stands for Generous Benefactor.’",
            "The old gentleman frowned. Then he said, ‘Your Father sent you here, I suppose?’",
            "‘No he didn’t,’ said Dicky. ‘Why did you think so?’",
